  "body": "**Blocked by:** #91\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue establishes the first implementation slice of the `mail-sync-hardening` batch; #202 builds on it.\n\n## Task\n\nWhen high-level download fails before completion, retry the part via bounded BODY[section]<start.count> ranges assembled as the same lazy Readable. Start a fresh replacement stream, stop EOF, enforce MAX_ATTACHMENT_BYTES, bounded chunk/retry, abort non-progress, clean resources.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Normal high-level streaming unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Fake midstream failure succeeds with ordered partial ranges.\n- EOF/cap deterministic.\n- Empty/nonprogress fails without loop.\n- Downstream stream/cap unchanged.\n",
